      About Meenakshi Technologies
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6;">
      Delivering reliable biometric attendance machines, door access control systems, and enterprise workforce management software across Hyderabad and Telangana.
