    <div>
      <span class="section-tagline">Our Background</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Your Trusted Partner for Biometric Security in Hyderabad</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        Meenakshi Technologies was established in Hyderabad, Telangana, with a singular dedication: empowering commercial enterprises, factories, educational institutions, and healthcare centers with dependable biometric security and automated workforce management technology.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
        We recognized that many organizations struggled with unreliable biometric suppliers—vendors who sold boxed hardware without understanding local network routing, without providing structured wiring, and without configuring payroll software exports. Meenakshi Technologies bridged this gap by offering a complete, full-lifecycle service model: from initial facility security assessment and authentic eSSL / Biomax hardware supply, to expert onsite mounting, electromagnetic lock alignment, software database configuration, and dedicated ongoing maintenance.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Today, Meenakshi Technologies operates from two verified physical locations in Hyderabad: our central corporate office and our dedicated Balapur branch, enabling rapid on-site dispatch and responsive customer assistance across Greater Hyderabad and all industrial corridors of Telangana.
      </p>

      <div style="background: #eef4f8; border-left: 4px solid #0066cc; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0b2545; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;">Core Operating Principles</h4>
        <ul style="list-style: disc inside; color: #334155; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7;">
          <li><strong>100% Authentic Hardware:</strong> Genuine eSSL and Biomax products with manufacturer warranties.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Guesswork:</strong> Transparent pricing, realistic technical specifications, and clear delivery timelines.</li>
          <li><strong>Local Accountability:</strong> Verified physical brick-and-mortar facilities in Hyderabad and Balapur.</li>
          <li><strong>Lifecycle Support:</strong> Ongoing software training, firmware updates, and rapid field assistance.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

